{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Bite the Moon</strong> is a <strong>deckless card battle roguelike</strong> where every fight forces you to <strong>draft on the fly</strong>. No safety net. No pre-built deck. Your win condition emerges in the heat of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Survive through improvisation:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Draft, don\u2019t deckbuild.</strong> Every pick is risk vs reward.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Explosive combos.</strong> Stack stats, trigger multipliers, and unleash chaotic chain reactions.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>High-stakes runs. </strong>Risk a draft, watch the chaos unfold, and see if luck is on your side.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless replayability.</strong> No run plays out the same way twice.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >This game offers:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Top-deck tension</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Reroll thrills</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Clutch combos</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bite the Moon rewards quick thinking, clever improvisation, and daring strategies you can\u2019t predict. Every battle keeps you guessing. Will you survive or get squished?</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918140?t=1756630467","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3918140?t=1756630467","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3918140/5ed5144fad25817be9ca2f87551f1de208b8c0cf/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756630467","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3